# rasayan — src/amino_catabolism.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's amino-acid catabolism tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 23 unit tests of `amino_catabolism.rs` and the 4 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only
# amino-acid catabolism and TCA, as they are written; tests/golden/amino_catabolism.tsv checks every method, single
# step, trajectory and Rust's amino-acid-to-TCA coupling besides. Beyond them: the trace event, accumulate, and the
# config's nested routing in JSON.

